### **3. RDF Triples (Turtle Format)**
```turtle
@prefix : <http://example.org/autonomous-driving#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:Scene1 a :AutonomousDrivingScene ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :HeavyRain ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :Nighttime ;
    :hasRoadCondition :WetRoad .

:HeavyRain a :WeatherCondition ;
    :reducesVisibilityTo 0.3 .

:Nighttime a :WeatherCondition ;
    :reducesVisibilityTo 0.4 .

:WetRoad a :RoadCondition ;
    :increasesSlipRisk 0.8 ;
    :reducesTraction 0.7 .

:EgoVehicle a :Vehicle ;
    :isOn :RoadSegment1 ;
    :hasHeadlightsActive true ;
    :hasVisibilityRange 0.2 .

:RoadSegment1 a :Road ;
    :hasMarking :DoubleWhiteLine ;
    :hasTrafficSign :NoOvertakingSign ;
    :hasTrafficSign :PedestrianCrossingSign ;
    :hasLighting :Streetlight .

:NoOvertakingSign a :TrafficSign ;
    :indicatesRestriction :Overtaking .

:PedestrianCrossingSign a :TrafficSign ;
    :indicatesPotentialHazard :PedestrianCrossing .

:Streetlight a :Infrastructure ;
    :providesIllumination true ;
    :hasEffectiveness 0.5 .
```

